  m_Text: "Welcome to Viso Game! These Terms and Conditions outline the rules and
    regulations for using the BarberMe app and services. By accessing or using our
    app, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree, please do not
    use our services. \r\n\r\n1. Definitions \r\n\"BarberMe\" refers to the platform,
    app, and services provided by [Your Company Name]. \r\n\"User\" refers to any
    individual who accesses the app, whether as a customer or a barber. \r\n\"Barber\"
    refers to the independent contractors providing barbering services through BarberMe.
    \r\n\"Customer\" refers to individuals booking services through BarberMe. \r\n\r\n2.
    Use of Services \r\nYou must be at least 18 years old to use BarberMe. \r\nBy
    using the app, you agree to provide accurate and up-to-date information during
    registration and booking. \r\nYou are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality
    of your account information. \r\n\r\n3. Booking and Payment Booking Process:
    \r\nCustomers can browse barbers, view their availability, and book services
    directly through the app. Payment: All payments are securely processed through
    the app via Square or other trusted payment gateways. \r\nCancellations:Customers
    may cancel appointments 24hr before the booking without penalty. Cancellations
    after the allowed timeframe may incur a fee. \r\n\r\n4. Responsibilities For
    Barbers: \r\nBarbers are independent contractors and solely responsible for providing
    services to customers. Barbers must comply with local licensing and health regulations.
    For Customers: Customers are responsible for providing accurate information for
    appointments (e.g., location, time). BarberMe is not liable for the quality of
    services provided by barbers. \r\n\r\n5. Prohibited Conduct Users agree not to:
    \r\nUse BarberMe for unlawful purposes. Provide false information during registration
    or booking. Harass, threaten, or harm other users (customers or barbers). BarberMe
    reserves the right to terminate accounts violating these terms. \r\n\r\n6. Liability
    Disclaimer \r\nBarberMe acts as a platform connecting customers and barbers.
    We are not liable for the actions, omissions, or performance of individual barbers.
    BarberMe does not guarantee the availability, quality, or suitability of any
    barber. \r\n\r\n7. Intellectual Property \r\nAll content, logos, and materials
    on BarberMe are the intellectual property of [Your Company Name]. Users may not
    copy, reproduce, or distribute any content without prior written consent. \r\n\r\n8.
    Termination \r\nBarberMe reserves the right to suspend or terminate any user
    account at our sole discretion, including but not limited to violations of these
    terms. \r\n\r\n9. Dispute Resolution \r\nAny disputes between customers and barbers
    must be resolved directly between the parties. BarberMe may assist as a neutral
    mediator but is not obligated to intervene in disputes. \r\n\r\n10. Changes to
    Terms \r\nBarberMe may update these Terms and Conditions periodically. Any changes
    will be posted, and continued use of the app signifies acceptance of the revised
    terms. \r\n\r\n11. Contact Us \r\nFor questions or concerns about these Terms
    and Conditions, please contact us: Email: support@barberme.com"
